# L §3.2 with L §5.16: a dist U row gives a distribution over quantities of unit U; normal(1 PLN, ...) for a
# dist with no unit mixes units (LOAD-UNIT).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input z: dist

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  z = normal(1 PLN, 1) to 1e-9
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
